Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Gather round, come take a look...{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}It's time for Theatre of Darkness.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}Solution{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\i1}This is the story of a certain police officer working at a police box...{\i0}{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hm? Why is there a doll in a place like that?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior, thanks for your hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,at the intersection on 4th Street,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a doll left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior, you were just off shift,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so you probably don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.25,0:00:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Two days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an accident involving a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the mother suffered a mental breakdown from the shock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and was wandering around that area for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.41,0:00:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She might have left it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That doll...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask for your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could she be hard of hearing...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that doll—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This child isn't a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Man, what a mess...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Senior, were you talking to someone just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.97,0:01:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well, this old lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.87,0:01:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,An old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.07,0:01:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.31,0:01:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.35,0:01:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to try ventriloquism with something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's lost property.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't take it home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.49,0:01:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm heading home then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Give the child back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:01:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You poor thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.23,0:02:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Honoka, who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.81,0:02:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,EH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.81,0:02:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came back from grocery shopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it was left right in front of the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.49,0:02:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,got into a fight with his friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,St-Stop that right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you do something so awful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.37,0:02:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,this doll is bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro-chan isn't a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro-chan isn't a doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.93,0:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What??
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.53,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, is Senior Takeuchi taking the day off today as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that seems to be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,our traffic safety instruction at the elementary school,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,is next week, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Officer Hatanaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And this here is my friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Taro-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, Taro-chan
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.33,0:03:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to talk to everyone about how to ride a bicycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}THE END.{\b0}
